<title>OMAN: Oman in $2.1 mln telecomms deal with Hughes.</title>
<headline>Oman in $2.1 mln telecomms deal with Hughes.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman on Monday signed a 796,797 rial deal with Hughes for the extension of telephone services in rural areas, the official Oman News Agency said.</p>
<p>Oman's Minister of Telecommunications Ahmed bin Suwaidan al-Balushi signed the deal. He said the agreement would take six months to be implemented and would help Oman expand its mobile telephone services to include remote villages and towns.</p>
</text>
